\begin{frame}{Appendix: AI Disclaimer}

The following AI-assisted language and coding models were used in the preparation of this work: Claude (Sonnet 4.6 and Opus 4.8,
Anthropic), ChatGPT Codex (Codex 5.3 and GPT 5.5, OpenAI).
\\[0.5em]
Claude and ChatGPT Codex were used to support the implementation of the coding pipeline, including code generation and
debugging, validation of model outputs, summarization of results, and the production of charts and figures.
\\[0.5em]
ChatGPT Codex additionally served as the execution environment for running the code pipeline. Claude was also used in a minor
supporting capacity during the preparation of presentation slides; however, all slides were conceived, structured, and finalized by
the human author, with AI assistance representing a negligible share of the final content.
\\[0.5em]
All AI-generated outputs were reviewed, critically assessed, and adapted by the author.
The data handling and model analysis were performed locally. Model training and index construction
were implemented via cloud computing (Vast.ai and GCP).

\end{frame}

